<p>Granite	  2,351/--- (LDD) 3,649/---   Her Ann	   08/03</p>
<p>Fluorspar	3,838/--- (LDD) 2,183/---   Long Chuan Jiang07/03</p>
<p>Coal	    11,028/--- (ULD) 8,262/---   Jayamkondan     08/03</p>
